---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support - Balm"
  description="Get help with Balm: report a bug, request a feature, or ask a question."
>
  <main class="prose wrap">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="effective">Balm is developed and supported by Kyle Scudder.</p>

    <h2>Report a bug or request a feature</h2>
    <p>The fastest route is a GitHub issue - include what you did, what you expected, and what happened instead:</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/kylescudder/balm/issues">github.com/kylescudder/balm/issues</a></p>

    <h2>Sign-in and account questions</h2>
    <p>Balm uses your Atlassian account. Password resets, permissions, and site access are managed by Atlassian or your Jira administrator - Balm can't change them. To disconnect Balm from your account at any time, revoke it at <a href="https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/apps">id.atlassian.com Connected apps</a>.</p>

    <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
    <p>Start with the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> - it's short and specific. Anything it doesn't answer, raise on GitHub.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
